Z||000000||JAMIE||11-06-2000||03:44 PM||||I have tried without luck to find a new heater control unit for my 88GT. The unit is the one without air conditioning.Located above cassette deck.The black face on mine is marred.<P>Does anyone know if the identical unit was used in other GM vehicles? Problem I have is that as soon as I give a Fiero part number from the P22 manual it comes back as discontinued. I believe this part was used in other vehicles but have been unable to get an alternate part number.Help.<P>Jamie||||reg||1
