Z||000002||sombre||11-07-2000||06:57 PM||||<BR>    Don't know about non-A/C unit.But the older pontiac 6000 STE's had one that will work on the A/C equipped cars.only difference is a pushbutton speed controll for the blower intead of the dial.I put one in my '84 about 8 years ago I don't remember having to change anything else.I've been looking for the same for my '86 but the STEs are almost as hard to find now as fieros...<P>                                  GReg<BR>||||reg||1
